 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hi! How are you doing these days?",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.62,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_26"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Good, good. Thanks.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.83,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_23"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "My wife turns seventy next month. I'd like music from when we were courting, but I don't know where to start.",
   "est_sec": 6.61,
   "gap_before": 0.57,
   "block": "birthday_party.dlg6",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That's a lovely idea. Roughly which years were you courting?",
   "est_sec": 3.2,
   "gap_before": 0.47,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "birthday_party.dlg6"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Oh, the late sixties. We danced a lot back then.",
   "est_sec": 3.2,
   "gap_before": 0.66,
   "block": "birthday_party.dlg6",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then think Motown, some early soul, and the big pop ballads from that era. Was there one song you danced to together?",
   "est_sec": 6.92,
   "gap_before": 1.19,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "birthday_party.dlg6"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Different question. I'm finally buying my first car.",
   "est_sec": 2.58,
   "gap_before": 1.24,
   "block": "cars.ctx3",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Congratulations! Have you thought about whether you want something new with a warranty, or a cheaper used one?",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 0.71,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "cars.ctx3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Let me think about that for eighteen seconds, then ask me once more.",
   "est_sec": 4.13,
   "gap_before": 1.05,
   "event": "instruction",
   "kind": "think_time",
   "wait_sec": 18,
   "phrasing": "think_instr_29"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Right, so first",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "anchor": {
    "turn": 8,
    "offset": 6.6
   },
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "self_talk",
   "phrasing": "self_13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Hmm, tough.",
   "est_sec": 0.72,
   "anchor": {
    "turn": 8,
    "offset": 13.52
   },
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "self_talk",
   "phrasing": "self_16"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "So, new with a warranty, or used and cheaper?",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "role": "resume",
   "block": "cars.ctx3",
   "anchor": {
    "turn": 8,
    "offset": 18.04
   }
  },
  {
